Description: Fitting extreme value distributions with parameters that vary 
    according to Gaussian Markov random fields (GMRFs). For details of distributions see Coles, S.G. (2001) <doi:10.1007/978-1-4471-3675-0>, GMRFs see Rue, H., & Held, L. (2005)) <doi:10.1201/9780203492024>, and the fitting approach see Wood, S.N., Pya, N. & Säfken, B. (2016) <doi:10.1080/01621459.2016.1180986>.
